WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.884 --> 00:00:17.624
pushed his way through the hedge as quietly as he could.

2
00:00:18.565 --> 00:00:21.145
Nora was halfway across the backyard by now.

3
00:00:21.165 --> 00:00:24.006
"Shh!" he warned the others.

4
00:00:24.026 --> 00:00:27.887
"Don't make too much noise, or she'll know we're here.

5
00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:29.868
And try to stay hidden!"

6
00:00:30.912 --> 00:00:34.955
He realized that it wasn't going to be easy to follow Nora without being spotted.

7
00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.416
They would have to be very careful.

8
00:00:38.897 --> 00:00:41.839
Luckily, there were plenty of tall shrubs in the backyard.

9
00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:45.362
Henry rushed out and ducked behind the closest one.

10
00:00:46.983 --> 00:00:49.244
A second later Cole joined him behind the shrub.

11
00:00:50.165 --> 00:00:51.946
Maggie and Nathan were right behind him.

12
00:00:51.966 --> 00:00:53.767
"Where's she going?"

13
00:00:54.087 --> 00:00:55.528
Cole whispered in Henry's ear.

14
00:00:57.029 --> 00:00:58.130
Henry peeked at Nora.

15
00:00:59.091 --> 00:01:00.712
She hadn't heard or seen them yet.

16
00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:04.341
But she sure didn't look as if she were sleepwalking.

17
00:01:05.341 --> 00:01:07.442
She stopped every few steps to look around.

18
00:01:07.462 --> 00:01:13.203
"I can't tell for sure, but it looks like she's heading toward the woods at the back of

19
00:01:13.223 --> 00:01:15.184
the yard," Henry whispered back.

20
00:01:15.204 --> 00:01:18.525
"Come on, let's try to get closer.

21
00:01:19.465 --> 00:01:21.766
We don't want to lose sight of her if she goes into the woods."

22
00:01:22.806 --> 00:01:25.247
They all dashed across the yard to another shrub.

23
00:01:26.227 --> 00:01:29.368
When they were safely hidden behind it, Henry peeked out again.

24
00:01:30.536 --> 00:01:32.457
Nora had stopped and turned around.

25
00:01:33.437 --> 00:01:35.337
She had a suspicious look on her face.

26
00:01:36.918 --> 00:01:39.019
Henry yanked his head back behind the shrub.

27
00:01:40.799 --> 00:01:42.640
Whew! Nora hadn't spotted him.

28
00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:46.541
He put a finger to his lips to warn the others to be quiet.

29
00:01:47.521 --> 00:01:49.562
They waited silently for a few seconds.

30
00:01:50.622 --> 00:01:52.182
Then Maggie peeked out.

31
00:01:53.203 --> 00:01:54.183
Her eyes widened.

32
00:01:54.203 --> 00:01:57.724
"Hey," she said, sounding excited.

33
00:01:59.144 --> 00:02:01.905
"It looks like she might be heading for Nathan's tree house!"

34
00:02:03.085 --> 00:02:03.845
Henry winced.

35
00:02:04.986 --> 00:02:07.546
In her excitement Maggie had forgotten to whisper.

36
00:02:08.627 --> 00:02:10.287
And her voice was always pretty loud.

37
00:02:11.347 --> 00:02:13.788
A second later he heard the sound of running feet.

38
00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:18.149
When he jumped out from behind the shrub, he saw Nora running away.

39
00:02:18.169 --> 00:02:21.890
"She heard us," he called to his friends.

40
00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:24.191
"Come on, let's catch her!"

41
00:02:24.211 --> 00:02:27.912
"Nora!" Nathan yelled as they all started running.

42
00:02:28.956 --> 00:02:31.718
"Stop!" But Nora didn't stop.

43
00:02:32.679 --> 00:02:34.920
That was no surprise, at least to Henry.

44
00:02:35.961 --> 00:02:40.244
As far as he could tell, Nora hardly ever did anything anyone told her to do!

45
00:02:41.705 --> 00:02:44.067
Nora was a pretty fast runner for a little kid.

46
00:02:45.108 --> 00:02:47.770
She raced across the yard and disappeared through the hedge.

47
00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:51.492
"She's in the neighbors' yard," Maggie said.

48
00:02:51.512 --> 00:02:56.436
"Hurry!" Henry ran as fast as he could toward the hedge.

49
00:02:57.428 --> 00:02:59.929
It was too thick to see anything on the other side.

50
00:03:01.449 --> 00:03:04.450
But he kept his eyes on the spot where Nora had pushed through.

51
00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:08.591
Cole was the fastest of all of them, so he got there first.

52
00:03:09.751 --> 00:03:13.152
"Ahh!" he yelled as he pushed through the hedge.

53
00:03:14.213 --> 00:03:15.633
"Hey, where'd she go?"

54
00:03:16.033 --> 00:03:17.253
he called from the other side.

55
00:03:18.254 --> 00:03:19.774
Henry pushed through the hedge too.

56
00:03:21.254 --> 00:03:23.315
He looked around and saw Cole standing there.

57
00:03:24.415 --> 00:03:26.556
A second later Maggie and Nathan appeared.

58
00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:29.117
But there was no sign of Nora.

59
00:03:29.137 --> 00:03:31.458
"Uh-oh," Cole said.

60
00:03:31.478 --> 00:03:33.338
"Do you think she's hiding?"

61
00:03:34.339 --> 00:03:38.460
Nathan was out of breath after all the running, so it took him a second to answer.

62
00:03:38.481 --> 00:03:41.422
"Probably," he said.

63
00:03:41.442 --> 00:03:43.663
"She likes to hide.

64
00:03:45.023 --> 00:03:48.905
Once she hid in the basement and my parents couldn't find her for over an hour."

65
00:03:50.185 --> 00:03:51.786
Henry looked around the neighbors' yard.

66
00:03:52.806 --> 00:03:56.748
It was smaller than Nathan and Nora's yard, but there were plenty of places to hide.

67
00:03:57.644 --> 00:04:03.266
There was a large vegetable garden with lots of big tomato plants, a patch of corn, and teepees

68
00:04:03.327 --> 00:04:04.507
covered with bean vines.

69
00:04:05.988 --> 00:04:11.290
The rest of the yard had shrubs and flowers, a birdbath, and a sculpture of a dog.

70
00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:16.212
At the back of the yard was the same forest that ran behind all the houses on the

71
00:04:16.232 --> 00:04:20.554
block. "Let's spread out and search for her," Henry decided.

72
00:04:20.574 --> 00:04:25.076
"Nathan, you go that way and search the neighbors' flower beds.

73
00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:29.022
Maggie, check the front yard and the other side of the house.

74
00:04:30.102 --> 00:04:32.924
Cole, make sure she's not hiding out in the woods.

75
00:04:33.924 --> 00:04:35.265
I'll check the vegetable garden."

76
00:04:35.285 --> 00:04:39.007
"Okay," Nathan said, and the others nodded.

77
00:04:40.008 --> 00:04:41.128
Then they split up.

78
00:04:42.589 --> 00:04:44.630
Henry hurried over to the vegetable garden.

79
00:04:45.671 --> 00:04:48.532
He peeked behind every tomato plant and bean teepee.

80
00:04:50.793 --> 00:04:52.174
He looked into the corn patch.

81
00:04:53.755 --> 00:04:55.436
He even checked under the wheelbarrow.

82
00:04:57.276 --> 00:04:59.058
But there was no sign of Nora.

83
00:05:00.038 --> 00:05:03.081
By the time he finished searching, his friends were coming back.

84
00:05:03.101 --> 00:05:07.144
"I didn't see her," Maggie reported.

85
00:05:07.164 --> 00:05:09.766
"Me neither," Cole said.

86
00:05:09.786 --> 00:05:11.707
"What about you, Nathan?"

87
00:05:11.727 --> 00:05:14.029
"Nope," Nathan said.

88
00:05:14.049 --> 00:05:16.611
"Did you find anything, Henry?"

89
00:05:17.652 --> 00:05:19.293
Henry shook his head and sighed.

90
00:05:19.313 --> 00:05:23.036
"It looks like Nora got away from us."
